first one\", \"do i have a photo of any of them\"], [\"delete Deepika note\", \"thirty five euros wine, Olomouc trip, I paid\", \"first one — who's coming?\", \"photo of any of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0043\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much Gresten Tran owes me for Olomouc, please?\"], [\"how much does Gresten Tran owe me in Olomouc\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0044\", \"v\": [[\"I'm getting ready for it and honestly can't remember who I asked, so who's invited to the call malgorzata?\", \"Different thing — I keep losing track of where I'm up to, so what's still left to do on the yew plan?\", \"Also, I'm trying to get a handle on my budget, so how much did I spend back in July?\", \"Oh and I've been hunting for it all morning — where's my sothix router?\", \"One last thing, I'd like to settle up with people soon, so who do I owe money to?\"], [\"who's invited to call malgorzata?\", \"what's left on the yew plan?\", \"spending in July?\", \"where's my sothix router?\", \"who do I owe money?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0045\", \"v\": [[\"I'm sure I saved something about it a while ago but can't remember where — could you find the wondery club for me?\", \"Separate question, we're trying to square up the house money, so what's Cathine's balance with me in the number 90 kitty?\", \"Oh and a friend asked me earlier and I completely blanked — what time is the marigold sale?\"], [\"can u find the wondery club\", \"whats Cathine's balance w me in the number 90 kitty\", \"what time's the marigold sale\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0046\", \"v\": [[\"I was trying to remember something from earlier in the week and it's bugging me — who did I have dinner with last monday?\", \"Totally different thing, I keep forgetting this number, so can you save the locker combination 89735 in the locker for me?\", \"Also, I'm putting together some old memories, so which shots mention Vadim?\", \"Nice, and while we're at it — what about Holan?\"], [\"who did i have dinner with last monday\", \"save my locker combination 89735 in the locker pls\", \"which shots mention Vadim\", \"what about Holan\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0047\", \"v\": [[\"The whole pasty thing fell through so none of it matters anymore — can you delete every pasty task I've got?\", \"Oh no, I actually still needed some of those, sorry — can you undo that and put them back?\"], [\"delete every pasty task\", \"oops, undo that\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0048\", \"v\": [[\"add Penfuan to the group\", \"number one — who's in it?\", \"hang on — expenses over forty euros?\", \"ok back — pics with any of those people?\"], [\"Could you please add Penfuan to the group?\", \"Could you tell me who's in number one first, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget — which expenses were over forty euros?\", \"Right, going back to that group — could you find me any pictures with any of those people in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0049\", \"v\": [[\"last contact with Ishaan?\", \"when's the parasol viewing?\"], [\"when was the last time i was in touch w Ishaan\", \"when do i have the parasol viewing\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0050\", \"v\": [[\"I need to get back into something and I'm pretty sure I saved them ages ago — can you pull up the backup codes thing?\", \"Also, I don't need that one hanging around anymore, so could you bin the Meskia task?\", \"No wait, I spoke too soon, I actually still need it — can you undo that?\"], [\"umm can you pull up the, uh, the backup codes thing?\", \"ok and, um, bin the Meskia task\", \"oh no wait wait, undo that\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0051\", \"v\": [[\"I've been clearing out old files and that one's not relevant anymore, so can you delete the Sothix document?\", \"Also, I keep forgetting it every time — the alarm code is 90088, can you keep that in the locker?\", \"And since I'm tidying up my pictures anyway, could you put the nectarine photo in the Winter 2027 album?\"], [\"Could you please delete the Sothix document?\", \"The alarm code is 90088 — would you mind keeping it in the locker for me?\", \"Would you please add the nectarine photo to the Winter 2027 album?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0052\", \"v\": [[\"I'm finally clearing out stuff I don't need any more, and that one's just clutter now — could you delete the telescope document?\"], [\"delete telescope document\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0053\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me, uh, anything to do with silo?\", \"oh hang on, what are the — the subtasks for the fix the cellar at nuncombe lido task?\", \"ok, back to the silo stuff — the Nuncombe one, um, which album's that in?\"], [\"I'm trying to pull together everything on one project in one place, so could you find anything to do with silo?\", \"Hang on, before I forget — I need to see what's involved, so what are the subtasks of the fix the cellar at nuncombe lido task?\", \"Ok, going back to the silo stuff from before — I'd like to show someone later, so which album is the Nuncombe one in?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I phoned Meskia today — could you please log that for me?\", \"Could you tell me where the vinegar form went, please?\", \"Would you please delete every ideas note I have?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry — could you undo that, please?\", \"Could you tell me whether I binned the flamingo task?\", \"Would you please move both Ulehaven things, the task and the calendar entry, to wednesday?\"], [\"umm I phoned Meskia today, can you log that?\", \"ok so where'd the, uh, the vinegar form go?\", \"can you, um, delete every ideas note I've got?\", \"oh wait no no, undo that\", \"hmm did I bin the flamingo task?\", \"ok and um move both the Ulehaven things — the task and the, uh, calendar entry — to wednesday\"]]}","ttft_ms":30220,"type":"result","duration_ms":45043,"uuid":"0645851d-86d3-4ea8-8878-ef2f888e9cb5","ttft_stream_ms":2777,"time_to_request_ms":109,"first_content_frame_ms":2778,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21837854,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278387941.6873,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
